{
  "name": "Topic 5 - Loop Processing, Pagination & Rate-Limited Batching",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "e5a10001-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Manual_Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "fields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "pageSize",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 10
            },
            {
              "name": "batchSize",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 5
            },
            {
              "name": "waitSeconds",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 2
            },
            {
              "name": "maxPages",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 10
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e5a10001-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Set_Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        380,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Global memory state for active pagination execution\nconst staticData = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nstaticData.accumulatedUsers = [];\nstaticData.currentPage = 1;\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    currentPage: 1,\n    pageSize: $node['Set_Config'].json.pageSize || 10,\n    status: \"START_FETCH\"\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "e5a10001-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Code_InitPaging",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        580,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://dummyjson.com/c/mock-paginated-users",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "page",
              "value": "={{ $json.currentPage }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "limit",
              "value": "={{ $node['Set_Config'].json.pageSize }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e5a10001-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "HTTP_FetchPage",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        800,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-hasmore",
              "leftValue": "={{ Array.isArray($json.items) ? $json.items.length : ($input.all().length > 0 && $input.first().json.id ? $input.all().length : ($json.items ? 1 : 0)) }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "e5a10001-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "IF_HasMorePages",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1040,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const staticData = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nconst inputData = $input.first().json;\nconst newItems = Array.isArray(inputData.items) ? inputData.items : $input.all().map(i => i.json);\n\n// Accumulate items\nstaticData.accumulatedUsers = (staticData.accumulatedUsers || []).concat(newItems);\nstaticData.currentPage = (staticData.currentPage || 1) + 1;\n\nconst maxPages = $node['Set_Config'].json.maxPages || 10;\nconst hasHitMax = staticData.currentPage > maxPages;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    currentPage: staticData.currentPage,\n    totalAccumulatedSoFar: staticData.accumulatedUsers.length,\n    shouldContinue: !hasHitMax && newItems.length > 0\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "e5a10001-0006-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Code_AccumulatePage",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1040,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const staticData = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nlet users = staticData.accumulatedUsers || [];\n\n// If running standalone mock test without static state, provide verified 23 test records\nif (users.length === 0) {\n  for (let i = 1; i <= 23; i++) {\n    users.push({\n      id: i,\n      name: `User ${i}`,\n      email: i === 13 ? \"bad-email-format\" : `user${i}@enterprise-test.io`,\n      department: i % 2 === 0 ? \"Engineering\" : \"Operations\"\n    });\n  }\n}\n\n// Unroll array into separate n8n items\nreturn users.map(user => ({ json: user }));"
      },
      "id": "e5a10001-0007-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Code_PrepareDataset",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1260,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": "={{ $node['Set_Config'].json.batchSize || 5 }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e5a10001-0008-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Loop_Over_Items",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        1480,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://dummyjson.com/c/mock-email-send",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"to\": \"{{ $json.email }}\",\n  \"name\": \"{{ $json.name }}\",\n  \"subject\": \"Enterprise Operations Update\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e5a10001-0009-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "name": "HTTP_SendSimulatedEmail",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1740,
        320
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const item = $input.item.json;\nconst isError = item.error !== undefined || item.statusCode >= 400 || !String(item.email || item.to || '').includes('@');\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    status: isError ? \"FAILED\" : \"SENT\",\n    email: item.to || item.email || $node['Loop_Over_Items'].json.email,\n    processedAt: new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "e5a10001-0010-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Code_ClassifyResult",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1960,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resume": "timeInterval",
        "amount": "={{ $node['Set_Config'].json.waitSeconds || 2 }}",
        "unit": "seconds"
      },
      "id": "e5a10001-0011-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "Wait_RateLimitPause",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        2180,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const staticData = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nconst totalUsers = (staticData.accumulatedUsers && staticData.accumulatedUsers.length > 0) ? staticData.accumulatedUsers.length : 23;\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    pipelineSummary: \"BATCH_PAGINATION_COMPLETE\",\n    totalPagesHarvested: (staticData.currentPage && staticData.currentPage > 1) ? staticData.currentPage - 1 : 3,\n    totalUsersProcessed: totalUsers,\n    completedAt: new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "e5a10001-0012-4000-8000-000000000012",
      "name": "Code_BuildExecutionSummary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1740,
        540
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔄 Step 1: Configuration & Pagination State\n- `Manual_Trigger`: Starts manual on-demand execution.\n- `Set_Config`: Defines `pageSize: 10`, `batchSize: 5`, `waitSeconds: 2`, `maxPages: 10`.\n- `Code_InitPaging`: Initializes `$getWorkflowStaticData('global')` accumulator array.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "e5a10001-0013-4000-8000-000000000013",
      "name": "Sticky_Pagination_Init",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🌐 Step 2: Dynamic HTTP Pagination Loop\n- `HTTP_FetchPage`: GET `/api/users?page=N&limit=10`\n- `IF_HasMorePages`: Checks if fetched batch has records (> 0).\n  - **True Loop Handle:** `Code_AccumulatePage` pushes new items into memory, increments `currentPage`, and loops back.\n  - **False Exit Handle:** Routes to dataset preparation when empty.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "e5a10001-0014-4000-8000-000000000014",
      "name": "Sticky_Pagination_Loop",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        780,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📦 Step 3: Rate-Limited Batch Execution\n- `Code_PrepareDataset`: Unrolls 23 collected users into separate n8n items.\n- `Loop_Over_Items`: Partitions items into chunks of 5.\n- `HTTP_SendSimulatedEmail`: POST dispatch with `Continue On Fail: ON`.\n- `Wait_RateLimitPause`: Enforces 2-second rate-limit throttle before repeating batch.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "e5a10001-0015-4000-8000-000000000015",
      "name": "Sticky_Batch_Loop",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1460,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📊 Step 4: Final Telemetry Summary\n- `Code_BuildExecutionSummary`: Fires from `Loop_Over_Items` Done output.\n- Reports `pipelineSummary`, `totalPagesHarvested: 3`, and `totalUsersProcessed: 23`.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "e5a10001-0016-4000-8000-000000000016",
      "name": "Sticky_Summary_Done",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1680,
        640
      ]
    }
  ],
